{
  "id": "poem-15090eb112d86319f234c138",
  "title": "前腔",
  "author": "高明《蔡伯喈琵琶记》",
  "dynasty": "元",
  "verses": [
    "不丰岁，荒歉年，生离死别真可怜。",
    "纵有八口人家，饥饿应难免。",
    "子忍饥，妻忍寒。",
    "痛哭声，恁哀怨。"
  ],
  "enabled": true,
  "collection": "元曲选",
  "source": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry/blob/b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee/元曲/yuanqu.json#record-5050",
